    "body": "父任务：#85；总体#57。状态：**Done / 本片G4已完成**。\n\n本片仅 10 个既有公共操作；不复制Node缺陷，以业务正确性、合理性和正式契约为准。\n\n- GET `/api/competitor-intelligence-records` — `CompetitorIntelligenceRecordController_list`\n- POST `/api/competitor-intelligence-records` — `CompetitorIntelligenceRecordController_create`\n- PATCH `/api/competitor-intelligence-records/{id}` — `CompetitorIntelligenceRecordController_update`\n- GET `/api/opportunity-stakeholders` — `OpportunityStakeholderController_list`\n- POST `/api/opportunity-stakeholders` — `OpportunityStakeholderController_create`\n- PATCH `/api/opportunity-stakeholders/{id}` — `OpportunityStakeholderController_update`\n- GET `/api/sales-discovery-records` — `SalesDiscoveryRecordController_list`\n- POST `/api/sales-discovery-records` — `SalesDiscoveryRecordController_create`\n- PATCH `/api/sales-discovery-records/{id}` — `SalesDiscoveryRecordController_update`\n- GET `/api/sales-intelligence-gaps` — `SalesIntelligenceGapController_list`\n\n- [x] G0：原生父子Issue、互斥归属及依赖\n- [x] G1：联合冻结与用户业务正确性纠偏\n- [x] 本片操作及必要内部生产链实现\n- [x] 实际HTTP/PG、原UI、故障并发及自有终态\n- [x] 独立G3复审、固定提交复核、main集成及读回\n- [x] 独立G4关闭许可、原字节归档及线上本地同步\n\n实现 `5ca4adfa7f8351a7515b14cdb3d08b6f7f2d1875`；原字节归档提交 `a720101037e7cbff06de132909991de1c746e0c2`。独立G3复审02及固定提交均Pass，已快进/push main并读回。最终Rust候选66db94ce，294 passed / 54 ignored；必要写整体回滚、精确金额、UUID身份与唯一提醒流均按业务语义实测。\n\n[收口索引](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3hijk-closeout.md)、[当前操作清单](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/rust-r3-operation-slices.json)、[原字节映射](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r3hijk/archive-origin-map.json)。四UI按精确候选和浏览器平台轴保留；WindowsRust server、完整R3非HTTP/审批/阶段验收及R4–R7未因此完成。旧失败/partial/uncertified/54ignored和quarantine边界保留。\n\nR3公共HTTP累计58/58，Rust总173操作；只完成本批#93–96，父#85/#57继续Open。完整阶段不能由HTTP计数代替。\n",
